> - 对象类：孤立像素/singleton_pixel, 锚块/anchor_block, 外框边缘/outer_frame, 前景对象/foreground_object, 残缺矩形/fragmented_rectangle, 连通分量/connected_component, 填充矩形/filled_rectangle, 控制像素/control_pixel, 缩略图/minimap, 色块网格/colored_block_grid, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 障碍段/barrier_segment, 起点像素/start_pixel, 射线网络/ray_network, 标记块/marker_block, 提取区域/extracted_region, 缺口矩形框/one_gap_rect_frame, 缺口像素/gap_pixel, 内部区域/interior_region, 十字图案/cross_shape, 标记块/marker_tile, 颜色图例/color_legend, 封闭孔洞/enclosed_hole, 环形前景/ring_object, 角位像素/corner_pixel, 边中像素/side_center_pixel, 半封闭墙/partial_enclosure, 障碍物/obstacle, 填充种子/fill_seed, 画布边界/canvas_boundary, 边缘行列/edge_row_column, 十字前景/foreground_cross, 横分隔线/divider, 标记掩码/marker_mask, 精灵体/sprite, 锚点精灵/anchor_sprite, 连接像素/connector_pixel, 前景像素/fg_pixel, 柱状条/histogram_bar, 分隔线/divider_line, 色块区域/colored_region, 整幅画布/full_canvas
> - 空间关系类：最近距离/nearest_distance, 行列跨度重叠/span_overlap, 角位指示方向/corner_indicates_dir, 坐标映射/coordinate_mapping, 跨障碍配对/cross_barrier_pair, 正交转向/perpendicular_turn, 行对齐配对/row_aligned_pair, 缺口定射线向/gap_determines_ray, 邻接侧决定方向/adjacency_side_determines_dir, 图例映射/legend_mapping, 反向循环/opposite_cycle, 开口方向/opening_direction, 交叉点中心/intersection_center, 两区域比较/region_comparison, 连接配对/connector_pairing, 调色板顺序/palette_order, 网格分区/grid_partition
> - 条件类：最短距离分配/nearest_frame_assign, 冲突优先级/conflict_priority, 移动并变色/shift_and_recolor, 合并对齐碎片/merge_aligned_fragments, 对角固定步移/diagonal_fixed_step, 已有块确认对齐/existing_blocks_confirm_alignment, 同行列两侧各一/one_each_side, 标记触发转向/marker_triggers_turn, 深度优先展开/depth_first_expand, 按顺序堆叠/stacked_in_order, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 不覆盖源对象/preserve_source_object, 孔洞保留不填/holes_preserved, 角与边中分组/corner_side_group, 障碍投射阴影/obstacle_casts_shadow, 边缘延伸角落留黑/edge_extrude_corner_black, 偶数切比雪夫距离/even_chebyshev_distance, 最大增长差/maximum_growth_difference, 逐步拼合/incremental_assembly, 计数渲染柱状图/counts_as_histogram, 每区域折叠单像素/region_to_pixel, 拼接镜像副本/append_mirror_copy
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

